The Weft is a collection of four to six adventurers that have traveled across [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]]. They're registered with [[Org/Althane/The Guild|The Guild]] and have completed some quests in the name of justice. Among them are [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]], [[People/Althane/Henrik|Henrik]], [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]] and [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]].
